Flowcam renderer
================

The drawing code in this package (src/shapes.ts, src/arrows.ts and parts of
src/index.ts) is ported from Excaliflow.

  Project:    Excaliflow
  Repository: https://github.com/Shubhamsaboo/awesome-llm-apps
  Path:       advanced_llm_apps/excaliflow/index.html
  Commit:     40b16b66e5257c528059bb93ca9410b55d39278a
  License:    Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)

Changes: the code was converted to TypeScript, stripped of the editor (selection,
hit testing, history, editing, sticky notes, lines, laser trail, node pulses),
and made a pure function of (board, view, timeMs).

